dw/20260214/1099303668643008512876120.jpeg/slHGNXeDPyhYNqXTJv6fmu5Ad2wKm23rj-8wbY_vMG0\"/><figcaption>徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260214/1099303678223323136319580.jpeg/tPx50YqLbawbB4oH8d7WTVQ2-5phelqk7vJBp-7yQac\"/><figcaption>徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260214/1099303669125353472423987.jpeg/0kEpjXiJXTui1aELQq3KpE9HT7WmZSFT5RQfa-UUH2s\"/><figcaption>徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260214/1099303671348465664724593.jpeg/cF_0C3Ok6GneTPgHbedoxVgEQirIcSr1-tlaRPrZWkQ\"/><figcaption>徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260214/1099303673156341760860172.jpeg/euC_vwTRvQlj6GRFoHfRIgJrbcElgb5H5V9sWeVfbFk\"/><figcaption>徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260214/1099303675979239424164273.jpeg/t1KDK5WnnoFQWNLAcHfGPVGUp8pYckWk1S8zptUvM6Y\"/><figcaption>徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260214/1099303670836760576192634.jpeg/-4s0nJWocoYG9Jy2Q9xrfZ5h7x65RE4nFm0G4RZtBuE\"/><figcaption>徐千京（Instagram@kerryhsu1217）</figcaption></figure><p>池秋美才發不自殺聲明！慘遭演藝工會提告　曹雨婷赴警局：絕不退讓</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T01:40:18.493793+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2066,"images":34,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}